title: '0002 · Duplicates share a cause, not a subject'
owner: support desk
status: proposed
reviewed: 2026-10-28
---

**Date:** 28 October 2026 · **Replaces:** [0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject) once accepted

## Context

Decision 0001 merges reports whose subject lines match. In #4471 that put three problems with
the same symptom into one ticket marked known ([the split](/kb/incidents/4471/split)). Subjects
describe the symptom; engineering needs one ticket per cause.

## Decision

Merge on subject during an incident, as now. Before a ticket is marked known, group it by cause
(`causes.ts`, plus what the desk read in each report) and split off every cause that is not the
ticket's own.

## Consequences

- Marking a big ticket known takes one extra pass, run by the kb, not by hand.
- A fix closes only the reports it causes; the rest stay visible.
